    "# Comprehensive SWOW+KEC+EEG+RT Multilingual Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** PCS Meta-Repo Team  \n",
    "**Date:** January 2025  \n",
    "**Version:** 1.0.0  \n",
    "**Repository:** pcs-meta-repo  \n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements a comprehensive audit of the integration between:\n",
    "- **SWOW** (Small World of Words) semantic networks across languages\n",
    "- **KEC** (Knowledge, Entropy, Curvature) metrics computation\n",
    "- **EEG** (Electroencephalography) neurophysiological data\n",
    "- **RT** (Reading Time) eye-tracking data\n",
    "\n",
    "### Languages Supported\n",
    "- **EN** (English)\n",
    "- **ES** (Spanish) \n",
    "- **ZH** (Chinese)\n",
    "- **NL** (Dutch)\n",
    "- **PT** (Portuguese)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Datasets Integrated\n",
    "- **ZuCo v1/v2**: Eye-tracking + EEG reading data\n",
    "- **DERCo**: EEG reading comprehension data\n",
    "- **GECO**: Eye-tracking reading data (EN/NL)\n",
    "- **LPP**: EEG reading data (French)\n",
    "- **OneStop**: Eye-tracking reading data\n",
    "\n",
    "### Statistical Methods\n",
    "- Descriptive statistics across languages\n",
    "- Mixed-effects linear models\n",
    "- False Discovery Rate (FDR) correction\n",
    "- Cross-validation and bootstrap confidence intervals\n",
    "- Publication-quality visualizations"
   ]
